      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "LWK  are delighted to bring 38 Oakwood Avenue to the market. This is a beautifully presented three-bedroom family home that offers bright, spacious accommodation in a mature and highly sought-after residential setting in the heart of Swords. This attractive property has been well maintained , providing a warm and welcoming home.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation begins with a warm and inviting entrance hallway that sets the tone for the rest of the property. To the front of the home is a bright, front-facing living room, an ideal space for relaxing or entertaining. To the rear, the property opens into a modern, fully refurbished kitchen that has been finished to a high standard and enjoys lovely views over the large rear garden, creating a wonderful connection between the indoor and outdoor living spaces.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the first floor comprises three spacious bedrooms, each offering ample storage and excellent natural light. A well-appointed family bathroom serves the accommodation, while a convenient hotpress is located on the landing.\r\n\r\nExternally, the property boasts a generous rear garden with excellent space for outdoor dining, gardening, children’s play, or future extension potential (subject to the necessary planning permission). To the front, there is ample off-street parking with space for multiple vehicles, adding further practicality to this appealing home.\r\n\r\nOakwood Avenue enjoys a superb location close to a wide range of local amenities. Swords Village and the Pavilions Shopping Centre are just a short distance away, offering an excellent selection of shops, restaurants, cafés, and leisure facilities. The area is well served by both primary and secondary schools, parks, sports clubs, and recreational amenities, making it an ideal choice for families. Dublin Airport is easily accessible, while the nearby M1 and M50 motorways provide convenient connections to Dublin City Centre and beyond. Excellent public transport links, including regular bus services and the Swords Express, ensure easy commuting.\r\n\r\nCombining a a well proportioned living spacer, generous outdoor space, and an exceptionally convenient location, 38 Oakwood Avenue represents an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, families, and those seeking a beautiful home in one of North Dublin’s most desirable residential areas.\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct \r\ninformation. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
      },
